# --- Dependency Security Notes ---
# H-27: bigint-buffer transitive dependency has a known CVE. This requires a
#   dependency update (not a .gitignore fix). Track and update when upstream
#   publishes a patched version. See CRIT chain: @solana/web3.js -> bigint-buffer.
#
# L-26: devDependency vitepress pulls in esbuild which has a moderate CVE.
#   DevDependencies do not affect production builds, but should be updated
#   periodically. Run `npm audit` to check current status.
#
# L-28: better-sqlite3 includes a native binary (prebuilt N-API addon) which
#   introduces supply chain risk. Pin exact versions, verify checksums, and
#   consider auditing the prebuilt binary or building from source in CI.
